# Blender UI Swedish review delta: shader and Geometry Nodes bake terminology
# Reviewed against Blender/TERMINOLOGY.md and archived Blender UI batches.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: Blender UI\n"
"Language: sv\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
